This project is an independent Swift implementation whose SVGA format
behavior and compatibility goals are informed by SVGAPlayer-iOS 2.5.8 and
the upstream SVGA format project:

  SVGAPlayer-iOS: https://github.com/svga/SVGAPlayer-iOS
  SVGA-Format: https://github.com/svga/SVGA-Format

Those upstream projects are distributed under the Apache License 2.0.

No Objective-C generated Protobuf source from SVGAPlayer-iOS is copied into
this repository. Any generated bindings added in future work must be produced
for this package from the applicable format definitions.
